d documents and may not be comprehensive or up-to-date. If you require more detailed or sensitive information, I recommend contacting the Andheri PS or the relevant authorities directly.\n\n**Investigation Best Practices:**\nIn general, the Karnataka Police follows established investigation best practices, including:\n\n* Filing FIRs within 24 hours of incident reports\n* Securing digital evidence (CCTV, mobile records) within 48 hours\n* Conducting suspect interrogations in accordance with the Karnataka Police Act guidelines\n* Coordinating with specialized units, such as the Cyber Crime Police Station or the Economic Offences Wing, as needed\n\nIf you have any further questions or concerns, please feel free to ask.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'who is the victim and suspect'}], 'model': 'llama-3.3-70b-versatile', 'stream': True, 'temperature': 0.2}}
